    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY DESCRIPTION</h2></strong><br>John, a tortured father whose life is turned upside down by the sudden and tragic death of his daughter. Ana, a guilt-stricken mother driven mad by her role in her daughter\u2019s accident. And Barbara, an innocent little girl gone too soon. But just what exactly happened?<br>A family torn apart by tragedy. Two parents begin to be haunted by strange visions and dreams of their daughter, Barbara. The lines between dream and reality begin to blur, turning life into a living nightmare. This horrifying sequence of events grows more and more sinister, as what is fact and what is fiction becomes more and more unclear. What really happened that day at the lake? The ghost of Barbara is the only voice who knows the truth, but are John and Ana listening?<br>Are you?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2></strong><br>Throughout the game, you can play as all 2 main characters, and they all have a story to tell, but don\u2019t let your eyes and ears deceive you. 2 stories bleed together, and it\u2019s up to you to make sense of this tragic tale before the game ends. Who you believe is up to you, but everybody\u2019s got a secret. Who will lie to you first?<br><br>Interactable objects will show a dot in the middle of the screen. However not all the objects that show dot are interactable objects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/ebeda318489e0d4eda31b73bdce0b08d.poster.avif?t=1724385330\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/ebeda318489e0d4eda31b73bdce0b08d.webm?t=1724385330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/ebeda318489e0d4eda31b73bdce0b08d.mp4?t=1724385330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You will have multiple choices. Each choice leads to a different ending.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/835184f8d6a410daafbcf225141ef959.poster.avif?t=1724385330\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/835184f8d6a410daafbcf225141ef959.webm?t=1724385330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850690/extras/835184f8d6a410daafbcf225141ef959.mp4?t=1724385330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Have issues or questions? Join to Discord channel - </u></i></strong></h2>",
